---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="GetPictora Terms of Service — understand the conditions for using our free online image tools. Simple, fair, and transparent."
>
  <section class="bg-surface-primary">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-primary sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-tertiary">Last updated: June 30, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">By accessing or using GetPictora, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">GetPictora provides free, browser-based image editing tools including resizing, compression, format conversion, cropping, rotation, and filtering. All processing occurs locally on your device — no files are uploaded to our servers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You agree not to use our tools for any illegal, harmful, or abusive purposes. This includes processing copyrighted material without permission, generating illegal content, or attempting to disrupt our services.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The GetPictora name, logo, website design, and source code are our intellectual property. You retain full ownership of any images you process using our tools.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">GetPictora is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to use our services. Always keep backups of your original files.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">6. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:getpictora@gmail.com" class="text-accent underline">getpictora@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
